# Everything else is tracked: aorus and the laptop sync through the private
# GitHub repo. Going public needs a fresh repo -- see pre-push.md P6.

# Python Cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Everything the app writes is per machine -- settings, history, logs,
# vocabulary, recordings. A missing vocabulary.txt reseeds from templates/.
userdata/
*.flac

# Junction to .agents/skills, which is tracked. Git stores no junctions; each
# machine makes it once -- see the sync skill's New machine section.
.claude/skills

# Secrets
.env
